msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.OVERHEAT_LINE"
msgid "Overheat Temperature: {0} (Material Overhaul: primary construction material melting point × 85%)"
msgstr "过热温度：{0}（材料革新：主建造材料熔点 × 85%）"

#. 过热温度行的提示（{0} 主建造材料名、{1} 材料熔点、{2} 过热阈值、{3} 致命温度）
#. STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.OVERHEAT_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BUILDINGEFFECTS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.OVERHEAT_TOOLTIP"
msgid "Material Overhaul: overheat threshold = 85% of the primary construction material's ({0}) melting point {1} = {2}.\nExceeding it damages the building; the working-temperature cap only stops production and gives no heat protection.\nFatal temperature: {3}."
msgstr "材料革新：过热阈值 = 主建造材料 {0} 的熔点 {1} × 85% = {2}。\n建筑本体超过该温度会过热受损；温区上限只停止生产，不提供耐热保护。\n致命温度：{3}。"

